\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {16}{\ignorespaces Configured arm definitions, not measurements. TM/TT: TCP mTLS/trusted; V: verbs trusted; A: adaptive; B: Busy. O-T/O-V: cold owner RPC; K-R/S-R/K-T: kernel-RDMA/SPDK-RDMA/kernel-TCP namespace reads. NVMe-oF polling/security describe its owner control channel, not kernel target polling. No SPDK/TCP arm. Coordinator cache off; lanes one at c1, four at c16; r0/r1 separate. Busy spins owner and coordinator read driver, not kernel busy poll. Unmatched dimensions: TLS/security, polling, RPC/direct I/O; NVMe control is verbs trusted Adaptive.}}{16}{table.caption.24}\protected@file@percent }
