\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {40}{\ignorespaces Cold device qualification per case. Completed requires a qualified receipt and device reads per success at least 0.9; this is not per-call NAND proof. Ratios/reasons are indexed from remote\_rw.md into cold\_qualification.csv. Owner c5 uses one lane and is lane-limited; no transport ranking follows. Unmatched dimensions: sync/grouping, RPC/security, index/routing, and host SSD (Native coordinator SSD versus owner SSD). Read lanes: Native 0, owner 1 at c1/c5 and 4 at c16; c5 owner reads are lane-limited, not a transport ranking. Floors are separate populations.}}{53}{table.caption.65}\protected@file@percent }
